'''Sol Heredit''' is a monster which spawns from [[breach]]es in [[Deadman: Annihilation]]. Unlike the regular version of [[Sol Heredit]], he only attacks with the [[Fortis_Colosseum/Strategies#Phase_1_(100%_HP,_1500_HP)|Spear 2]] version of his auto-attack. The attack stops at scenery objects, so it is possible to dodge the attack by standing behind an object.

